          "title": "PDF 第 37 頁 · 163",
          "original": "In a rented Mustang convertible, with a photographer at the wheel, we headed wer to Santa Cruz and what was recommended as the Bay Area's best sauna, which was on the grounds ofa New Age/nudist retreat.",
